      "messageContent": "Urgent\n\nNotice\n\nA protest will be organized by the Congress Party against the NDA Government on the India–USA Trade Deal and for the demand of Statehood for Jammu & Kashmir.\n\nThe protest will be led by Sh. Tariq Hameed Karra Ji, President JKPCC.\n\nAll senior leaders, PCC office bearers, PCC members, ex-legislators, frontal and cell heads, district office bearers, Block Presidents, Ward Presidents, Ex. councillors, contested candidates, workers and supporters belonging to the Jammu District (U&R) are requested to join the protest.\n\nDate: 09 March 2026 (Monday)\nTime: 11:00 AM\nVenue: PCC Office, Shaheedi Chowk, Jammu\n\nRegards,\nPresident\nDistrict Congress Committee Jammu (Urban & Rural)2:36 pm",
